// Pop piano written for Anode. Right hand (rh), a token per sixteenth: C the voicing (c softer), T its top voice, U all
// but its bottom, 1-4 one voice from the bottom; left hand (lh): R the bass, 5 the fifth, 8 the root's octave;
// ! accent, ? soft; - holds, . rests; | marks beats.
